  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Question 1.7 (2 pts)\n",
    "Create a new column called speed that computes the speed as distance/air_time"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 22,
   "metadata": {
    "deletable": false,
    "nbgrader": {
     "cell_type": "code",
     "checksum": "2ba7c8c1e0c536052db7acc529e01d29",
     "grade": false,
     "grade_id": "grade_7",
     "locked": false,
     "schema_version": 3,
     "solution": true
    },
    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": ""
    },
    "tags": []
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# YOUR CODE HERE\n",
    "df['speed'] = df['distance'] / df['air_time'] "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 23,
   "metadata": {
    "deletable": false,
    "editable": false,
    "nbgrader": {
     "cell_type": "code",
     "checksum": "9f0ea1ee2fd72f00fdebd55a86d80cde",
     "grade": true,
     "grade_id": "load_7",
     "locked": false,
     "points": 2,
     "schema_version": 3,
     "solution": false
    },
    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": ""
    },
    "tags": []
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "assert type(df['speed']) == pd.Series \n",
    "assert abs(df['speed'][0] - 6.1674) < 1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Question 1.8 (4 pts)\n",
    "Segment the dep_time 24 hours into \n",
    "* night from 12 midnight to 5 am\n",
    "* morning from 5:01 am to 12 noon\n",
    "* afternoon from 12.01 noon to 5 pm\n",
    "* evening from 5.01 pm to 12 am\n",
    "\n",
    "And then run a query to find the total flights in each segment and save that value in the given variable.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 26,
   "metadata": {
    "deletable": false,
    "nbgrader": {
     "cell_type": "code",
     "checksum": "cd4234cba83a211f32d65bd4182de446",
     "grade": false,
     "grade_id": "grade_8",
     "locked": false,
     "schema_version": 3,
     "solution": true
    },
    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": ""
    },
    "tags": []
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "parts_of_day_count = ...\n",
    "# YOUR CODE HERE\n",
    "parts_of_day_night = df[(df['dep_time'] >= 0) & (df['dep_time'] <= 500)].shape[0]\n",
    "parts_of_day_morning = df[(df['dep_time'] >= 501) & (df['dep_time'] <= 1200)].shape[0]\n",
    "parts_of_day_afternoon = df[(df['dep_time'] >= 1201) & (df['dep_time'] <= 1700)].shape[0]\n",
    "parts_of_day_evening = df[(df['dep_time'] >= 1701) & (df['dep_time'] <= 2400)].shape[0]\n",
    "parts_of_day_count = {\n",
    "    'night': parts_of_day_night,\n",
    "    'morning': parts_of_day_morning,\n",
    "    'afternoon': parts_of_day_afternoon,\n",
    "    'evening': parts_of_day_evening\n",
    "}"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 27,
   "metadata": {
    "deletable": false,
    "editable": false,
    "nbgrader": {
     "cell_type": "code",
     "checksum": "4b90494c4cacf16d0ca28d87fc257c97",
     "grade": true,
     "grade_id": "load_8",
     "locked": false,
     "points": 4,
     "schema_version": 3,
     "solution": false
    },
    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": ""
    },
    "tags": []
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "assert parts_of_day_count['morning'] == 129939\n",
    "assert parts_of_day_count['evening'] == 98362"
   ]
  },
